Package: awscrt
Title: Hardware-Accelerated 'CRC Checksums' from the AWS Common Runtime
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Dyfan", "Jones", , "dyfan.r.jones@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates", role = c("cph"),
           comment = "Author of the bundled aws-checksums and aws-c-common libraries"))
Description: Computes 'CRC32', 'CRC32C' and 'CRC64NVME' 'checksums' using the
    'aws-checksums' library from the 'AWS' Common Runtime, with runtime
    dispatch to hardware instructions ('SSE4.2', 'PCLMULQDQ', 'AVX-512',
    'ARMv8' 'CRC' and 'PMULL') and a portable software fallback.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/paws-r/aws-crt-r, https://paws-r.r-universe.dev/awscrt
BugReports: https://github.com/paws-r/aws-crt-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: GNU make, C compiler
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
